cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as described below."
type: software
title: "StoppedFlowKinetiX: stopped-flow CD kinetic analysis of G-quadruplex folding"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
authors:
  - family-names: Krikava
    given-names: Filip
    affiliation: "Institute of Biophysics of the Czech Academy of Sciences; Masaryk University"
  - family-names: Palacký
    given-names: Jan
    affiliation: "Institute of Biophysics of the Czech Academy of Sciences"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application (StoppedFlowKinetiX, PyQt5) and Jupyter notebook for the analysis of
  Chirascan stopped-flow circular dichroism kinetics: averaging of selected repeats, removal of
  dead-time points, baseline subtraction, conversion to molar circular dichroism, one-, two- and
  three-exponential model fitting with confidence intervals and diagnostics, model comparison
  (AIC/BIC, F-test of nested models) and Excel export.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Filip-droid/chirascan-stopped-flow-cd-kinetics"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23059866
keywords:
  - circular dichroism
  - stopped-flow
  - kinetics
  - G-quadruplex
  - Chirascan
  - curve fitting
  - PyQt5
